 return `<div class="externalToolPanel"><div class="externalToolIcon">${esc(t.icon)}</div><h3>${esc(t.name)}</h3><p>This tool is listed in TheToolBus public catalogue. The full workflow opens on the provider's website. It is not copied into SKYNET Toolbox.</p><div class="notice"><b>Privacy check before continuing:</b> This is an external website. File handling and privacy depend on that provider and on the individual tool. Do not upload Aadhaar, PAN, bank records, student records, passwords, private photos or confidential customer files unless you have reviewed the provider's terms and are comfortable with its data handling.</div><p class="hint">Provider page: <span class="externalUrl">${esc(safeHref)}</span></p><div class="actions"><button class="btn" id="openProviderBtn">Open provider tool ↗</button><button class="btn alt" id="copyProviderBtn">Copy link</button></div><p class="hint">Opening the link is optional. No file or form data from this SKYNET page is sent automatically.</p></div>`;
